<title>USA: Network Equipment names Wolf chairman.</title>
<headline>Network Equipment names Wolf chairman.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Network Equipment Technologies Inc said on Monday it had named Hans Wolf as chairman. He succeeds John Arnold, who retired.</p>
<p>Wolf has been a director of the company since August 1992.</p>
</text>
